    "body": "ShadowDOM you a needed only to sandbox styling or protect the content from undesired access, it’s a specification a part, not something strictly related to custom elements. So with builtin you can do anything you’d do with shadow DOM except you won’t have guards for styles and inner tree.\r\n\r\nbut maybe that’s not what you’re after 🤷‍♂️",
