    "updated_at": "2022-03-09T09:53:20Z",
    "body": "I suppose it's worth asking what @whatwg/components thinks about this, but personally I'm not super keen on extending this list of elements. In fact, if we could change things retroactively I'd probably have only supported custom shadow trees on custom elements.",
